        <span class="sectionTag">Our story</span>
        <h2>We swapped boring office jobs for rail passes, street food, and honest trip notes.</h2>
        <div class="postParagraph">
            <span class="postBlock">Hello. We are Kassie and Nicola from New Zealand.</span>
            <span class="postBlock">In 2025 we decided we were too young for boring office jobs, so we quit, packed up our lives, and started travelling full-time. We are currently based in Madrid, Spain, working part-time as English language assistants and using the rest of the week to explore Europe.</span>
            <span class="postBlock">We travel cheaply and deliberately. We care more about the best local bite and a safe late-night walk home than polished luxury recommendations.</span>
            <span class="postBlock">This project exists to help other queer travellers find places that feel welcoming, affordable, and worth the effort.</span>
        </div>
