        <span class="sectionTag">Budget</span>
        <h3>Travel that survives contact with reality.</h3>
        <p>Hostels, off-peak trains, bakery lunches, and the kind of practical recommendations that matter when you are watching every euro.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="valueCard">
        <span class="sectionTag">Safety</span>
        <h3>Queer perspective built in.</h3>
        <p>We note how places feel, not just how they photograph. That includes vibe, comfort, and whether we would recommend them to other queer couples.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="valueCard">
        <span class="sectionTag">Taste</span>
